  "bodyHash": "VCCTmiw0XeA=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpeKQZQ.png\" alt=\"Supplementaries Mod\" width=\"1519\" height=\"855\"></a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;undefined</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">[![Supplementaries Discord](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv</a>) [![在 Patreon 上支持我](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar</a>) [![Supplementaries Twitter](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbadges.penpow.dev%252fbadges%252fsocial%252ftwitter-plural%252fcozy.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez</a>) [![Youtube 頻道](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Supplementaries 是一個高度可配置的 Forge 模組，專注於添加有價值的內容，填補原版遊戲的空白。其功能旨在實用、美觀，並與現有內容相輔相成，提供許多新方式來增強你的原版+體驗。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組需要 <strong>Moonlight Library</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雖然有支援，但 Fabric 版本可能缺少一些次要功能，因為此模組主要為 Forge 開發</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以自由將此模組加入你的模組包中</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;已翻譯成以下語言：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Deutsch | Polski | Français | Русский | Italiano | English | Čeština | 한국어 | Українська | Português | Српски | Español | Қазақ | Bahasa Melayu | Pirate Speech | 简体中文 (中国) | 繁體中文 (香港) | 繁體中文 (台灣) | Türkçe</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🖼️ 媒體 🖼️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">預告片：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZTN_DWP5d3o?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在此查看一些評論</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>其他評論：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1r07kI3xrOg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1r07kI3xrOg</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組開發佔用了我很多時間，所以如果你喜歡我的作品，並想支持我，可以在這裡這麼做。如果你支持我，你將獲得專屬於你的客製化<strong>地球儀</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用「supplementaries」代碼從 Akliz 購買伺服器，也同樣適用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？看看 Akliz，他們為模組 Minecraft 提供頂級品牌的伺服器。</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們真的有一個溫馨的社群，提供出色的支援，而且伺服器運行得非常棒。<br>使用代碼「supplementaries」可獲得<strong> 20% 折扣</strong>，同時也能支持我！</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fsupplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❓ 常見問題 ❓</strong></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：如何停用/調整 X 功能？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;請參考<strong> Wiki</strong> 中的自訂章節，或加入我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fqdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：你能更新/降級到 X 版本嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;我計劃最終將模組移植到每個新的主要 Minecraft 版本，所以請耐心等待。<br>至於降級，絕對不行，我對支援舊的過時版本沒有興趣。維護這一個版本已經佔用了我很多時間，而且這些版本之間變化太大，我幾乎需要重新學習如何製作模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：你能添加 X 功能/方塊嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong> 我鼓勵你加入我們的 Discord。我們有一個專門針對這類建議的專區。如果我覺得你的想法足夠合適，它很有可能會被加入。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：如何使用 X 方塊/物品？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong> 再一次，請參考<strong> Wiki。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：如何解決這個問題/崩潰？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;請在問題區開啟回報，並務必附上<strong>崩潰報告。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：Fabric 版本缺少 X</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：&nbsp;</strong>Supplementaries 主要是 Forge 模組，如果缺少某些功能，表示該功能沒有簡單或容易的實現方式，因為 Fabric 缺少某個 Forge API 提供的對應功能，而該功能嚴重依賴於那個 API。更多資訊請查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fJdipbyU.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;undefined</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🏆 致謝 🏆</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">很多人為模組貢獻了素材和紋理，名單太長無法在此列出。然而，若想在遊戲中直接查看它們，請將一本名為「credits」的書放在佈告欄上。</span></p>\n</blockquote><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，有些音效來自 Zapsplat，在此感謝他們<br><br></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vista\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1488/645/638967363014143781.gif\" alt=\"Vista\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/997/638414771733478975.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/992/638414764957723804.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"Sleep Tight\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/931/583/638405407858849835.png\" alt=\"Polytone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"Heartstone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/878/615/638305506575137108.png\" alt=\"Map Atlases\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/946/638414707400791480.png\" alt=\"Universal Sawmill\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/951/632/638441223877296738.gif\" alt=\"Amendments\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></span></span></p>",
